## 4. Sellers

Sellers were identified as follows: {% for k, v in conf_counts.items() %}{{ k }} {{ v }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}.

- **explicit**: a shop name in Source (2024–Sep 2025).
- **fingerprint**: a Goofish link whose `spm=…personal.feeds.N.XXXX` code matches a storefront.
  These codes were learned from rows that have both a shop name and a link (table below).
- **inferred**: an N3DS bought since {{ "Sep 2025" }} without "dif seller" and without other
  evidence, attributed to your main seller.
- **link**: only a listing or user ID is known.
- **unknown**: a pasted listing title or empty Source.

