### Order tabs vs. Sales Sheet

- {{ purchases_n }} order lines parsed, {{ purchase_units_n }} of them sellable units (the rest are repair/mod parts).
- {{ matched_n }} Sales Sheet rows were matched to an order line (same category, price within €2.50, close date, similar name).
- {{ pre_sales_units }} units were ordered before your first Sales Sheet purchase ({{ first_sale_buy }}),
  mostly the 2024 Japan orders of GBC/GBA/N3DS consoles. Their sales aren't recorded in the Sales Sheet.
- {{ sales_unmatched_n }} Sales Sheet rows have no matching order line.
- {{ unmatched_n }} unit lines from {{ first_sale_buy }} on have no Sales Sheet row. These are possibly
  still in transit, or units that were never added:

